  "reserve_rules": [
    "Reserve a counted slot before every fresh model conversation, including a failed initialization.",
    "Same-ID follow-ups stay within the allocated max_turns; an unexpected ID is another conversation.",
    "No child/helper/model spawning from subjects or reviewers; an unexpected descendant consumes a slot and stops dispatch for reconciliation.",
    "Reserve use needs a retained infrastructure/capture failure or missing unusable output, not an unfavorable result, ordinary task error, calibration failure or extra candidate iteration.",
    "A diagnostic consumes a slot; reserve is not replenished by failure. No automatic retries or budget extension."
  ],
